# Coordinate probe for the DESK34 and DESK35 runs on THIS card image
# (method/seed.sh qedroot: tools/make-sd-image.sh plus C:\QED.NAP + C:\qed.rsc,
# so the C:\ window's item grid is not the one any earlier action list used).
# probe_patch.py's `probe_icons` prints every desktop icon and every window item
# with the point that hits it; every click coordinate in d34.actions /
# d35.actions comes from this dump.
#
#   C: drive icon around (37,42) -- left of the first window's left edge (48),
#   so it stays clickable after a window is open.
200 parkbr
1000 arm
1100 mark A_IDLE
1500 move 37 42
1700 down
1703 up
1710 down
1713 up
2300 move 600 240
2900 mark B_WIN1
3500 mark C_END
